	"note": "Ground truth measured by running each pattern against adversarial input, not derived from the detector's rule. `measured` is exponential when doubling the input multiplied the time by more than 50x or blew a 2s budget. `reported` records what the detector says now, so a change to it is visible as a diff rather than a claim.",
